MAIN
MOVE TEMP 16 4
MOVE TEMP 17 HALLOCATE TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 4
MOVE TEMP 19 HALLOCATE TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 ParamTest_ved_TestParams
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 21
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 22 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 22
PRINT TEMP 4
END
ParamTest_ved_TestParams [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 23 4
MOVE TEMP 24 HALLOCATE TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 25 8
MOVE TEMP 26 HALLOCATE TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 27 TEMP 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 28 Calculator_ved_Add
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 29 Calculator_ved_Multiply
HSTORE TEMP 4 4 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 30 10
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 31 20
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 31
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 0
MOVE TEMP 32 CALL TEMP 8 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 5 TEMP 6 )
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 9
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 33 5
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 34 7
MOVE TEMP 11 TEMP 34
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 12 4
MOVE TEMP 35 CALL TEMP 13 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 10 TEMP 11 )
MOVE TEMP 14 TEMP 35
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 14
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 36 0
MOVE TEMP 15 TEMP 36

RETURN TEMP 15
END
Calculator_ved_Add [ 3 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 37 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 37

RETURN TEMP 3
END
Calculator_ved_Multiply [ 3 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 38 TIMES TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 38

RETURN TEMP 3
END

